 "notes": {
  "weeks": "FY W33..W40 = ISO 2026-W34..W41 (Mon-Sun), Mondays 2026-08-17 to 2026-10-05; LY L37..L40 = Mondays 2025-09-15 to 2025-10-06 at -364 days",
  "bookings": "eventCount, eventName EXACT 'sevenrooms_booking_complete'",
  "ytd_window": "2026-01-01..2026-10-11",
  "series_provenance": "W33..W38 users carried from the published w2026-09-28 raw file; W39 and W40 users pulled this run (W39 restated up: Aqua NYC 6,224 to 6,254, Hutong NYC 2,650 to 2,653, Hutong Miami 1,598 to 1,599). All bookings W33..W40 and L37..L40 re-pulled daily and summed this run; W39 bookings restated up: Aqua NYC 195 to 199, Hutong NYC 127 to 130, Hutong Miami 69 to 70. W33..W38 bookings reproduce the published figures to the booking.",
  "ga4_engagement_restatement": "Prior-week bounce and engagement rates restated again: Aqua NYC bounce 0.451 to 0.426, Hutong NYC 0.293 to 0.318, Hutong Miami 0.330 to 0.324. Prior-week sessions and users also restated up materially at Aqua NYC (7,198 to 7,613 sessions, 5,904 to 6,254 users). Session-scoped engagement metrics are still settling when the weekly run happens, so read the current week's bounce and engagement as provisional.",
  "hutong_nyc_ly_gap": "Verified this run, not assumed. A daily pull of sevenrooms_booking_complete across 15 Sep to 20 Oct 2025 returns rows only to 22 Sep 2025 (1 booking) and then nothing until 15 Oct 2025 (40 bookings). The reporting week 6 to 12 Oct 2025 therefore sits wholly inside the SevenRooms widget tracking outage and returns 0 bookings on 5,712 sessions. Meta reports 5 schedule_total and the Google 'Sevenrooms Booking Complete' action reads 16.17 for the same week, both unusable. Last-year bookings for this venue are withheld for W38, W39 and W40.",
  "aqua_nyc_split": "Aqua Roma = combined Aqua NYC minus Aqua Kyoto. Kyoto users pulled with a pagePath PARTIAL_REGEXP filter 'kyoto|aquakyotonyc' one week at a time with no date dimension; Kyoto bookings pulled with andGroup(eventName=sevenrooms_booking_complete, pagePath PARTIAL_REGEXP 'aquakyotonyc'). Kyoto W39 restated DOWN from 24 to 21 bookings and up from 1,069 to 1,075 users; pagePath-scoped event attribution can move either way."
